### 4. Verify Fixed Issues

Verify that the fixes have resolved the component issues:

```typescript
// 1. Run type checking to verify type fixes
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run type-check", false, false)

// 2. Run linting to verify code quality fixes
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run lint -- front-end/src/components/[ComponentName].tsx", false, false)

// 3. Run tests to verify functional fixes
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm test -- --findRelatedTests src/components/[ComponentName].tsx", false, false)

// 4. Check component rendering to verify visual fixes
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run storybook", false, true)

// 5. Check accessibility to verify a11y fixes
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run test:a11y", false, false)
```

